<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets China Resources warrants.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets China Resources warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said it intended to issue 260 million American style call warrants on shares of China Resources Enterprise Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$6.12     PREMIUM	 13.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.196    GEARING	 3.65X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  28.AUG.97   PAYDATE	 3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG   MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$7.15</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
